        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia's Revenge is a top-down 2D pixel-based game where players fight enemies with firearms and solve puzzles to progress through the story, while making choices at branch points that lead to two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/2548c9cfaaeac22003ecb1769f39d226.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia, originally an Elite Agent working for Eternal Life, a giant corporation that has created an entire virtual world within a simulation, discovers she has been betrayed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/60afa60e3fc8f944899673a973feeb9b.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She becomes the leader of the Rebel Faction and hides within the world of the simulation to seek her revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, she is betrayed by her subordinate, Philip, causing the Rebel Faction to collapse and throwing her into great danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/9ecf2800f82fd481cfb6f3f73c7eb9bd.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, in a dramatic turn of events, Nadia is revived with the help of Olivia, the most powerful entity in the simulation and the enemy of Eternal Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia sets out to reform the Rebel Faction and vows to take revenge on both the traitorous Philip and Eternal Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, Nadia acquires a variety of weapons that she uses to defeat enemies, and solves puzzles to continue her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can also send her newly recruited Rebel Agents on missions, earning SP points and gold that can be used to increase her stats and upgrade her weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/ca07e3e605b3c2cf4cd6f87add9f6683.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, depending on her choices, she can select one of two possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/f5146c83957ba44a160c43a999c1004e.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia's Revenge is a top-down 2D pixel-based game where players fight enemies with firearms and solve puzzles to progress through the story, while making choices at branch points that lead to two different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/2548c9cfaaeac22003ecb1769f39d226.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia, originally an Elite Agent working for Eternal Life, a giant corporation that has created an entire virtual world within a simulation, discovers she has been betrayed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/60afa60e3fc8f944899673a973feeb9b.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She becomes the leader of the Rebel Faction and hides within the world of the simulation to seek her revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, she is betrayed by her subordinate, Philip, causing the Rebel Faction to collapse and throwing her into great danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/9ecf2800f82fd481cfb6f3f73c7eb9bd.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, in a dramatic turn of events, Nadia is revived with the help of Olivia, the most powerful entity in the simulation and the enemy of Eternal Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nadia sets out to reform the Rebel Faction and vows to take revenge on both the traitorous Philip and Eternal Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, Nadia acquires a variety of weapons that she uses to defeat enemies, and solves puzzles to continue her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can also send her newly recruited Rebel Agents on missions, earning SP points and gold that can be used to increase her stats and upgrade her weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/ca07e3e605b3c2cf4cd6f87add9f6683.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, depending on her choices, she can select one of two possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985480/extras/f5146c83957ba44a160c43a999c1004e.avif?t=1761181649\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Nadia's Revenge is the story of Nadia, the leader of the Rebel Faction in a simulated world. She must upgrade various firearms, increase her skills, defeat enemies, and solve different types of puzzles to progress through the story and shape her own fate.",
